      "writtenOn": "2024-01-03T23:00:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we don\u0027t change these numbers much I think this is fine, otherwise we might want to self refer like:\n\n```\n#define VIVALDI_TK_ABSENT 0\n#define VIVALDI_TK_BACK VIVALDI_TK_ABSENT + 1\n\n```\n\nBut given that these will be included into a DT overlay, I don\u0027t even know if this is feasible.\n\nIf it isn\u0027t feasible or if we don\u0027t expect these to really ever change then please resolve and ignore this comment.",
      "revId": "a6dc478ec37b140e4997d46d45344bea8c349f1c",
